== Quest ==
{{Main|Trials of Fire}}

'''Ryan''' is the leader of the campfire cult, where in order to join their cult, you must pass the [[Trials of Fire]]. In the [[Trials of Fire]], the player must survive burning in a fire lasts 10 Seconds, doing varying amounts of {{Stat|tdmg}} depending on the level.

The player gets the [[Campfire Initiate Badge]] and becomes a member of the campfire cult after passing Level II. Every time the player survives the 10 seconds burning in the campfire, Ryan will upgrade the badge by right-clicking him with the badge in the hand.

== Trivia ==
* '''Ryan '''seems to be a reference to the NBC sitcom "The Office" named after Ryan Howard, a main character on the show. The [[Trials of Fire]] accessory has a tag on the bottom that says "Fire guy!" in quotes. Ryan Howard once started a fire in The Office and was nicknamed Fire Guy.

